      "content": "✅ Plot plan finalized:\n# Ghost Hacker - Episode Analysis \u0026 Cinematic Sketch Generation\n\n## Current Status\n**Episode ID:** 260123-cschool-privacy\n**Page:** 0, Panel: 0\n**Status:** New episode initialization - No cinematic sketches generated yet\n\n---\n\n## Narrative Summary - \"C-School Privacy Crisis\"\n\n### Episode Theme\nA privacy breach at an elite cyber-security training academy threatens to expose students' real identities, putting undercover operatives and witnesses in protection programs at risk.\n\n### Key Story Beats\n\n**ACT 1 - Discovery (Panels 1-3)**\n- Opening: C-School campus establishing shot - futuristic academy\n- Protagonist receives encrypted alert about data leak\n- First victim: Student's cover blown, family targeted\n\n**ACT 2 - Investigation (Panels 4-7)**\n- Protagonist infiltrates school's secure server room\n- Discovers insider threat - compromised faculty member\n- Chase sequence through digital and physical space\n- Revelation: Larger conspiracy targeting protected identities\n\n**ACT 3 - Resolution (Panels 8-10)**\n- Confrontation with antagonist in virtual space\n- Race to secure remaining student data\n- Cliffhanger: Mastermind's identity partially revealed\n\n---\n\n## Required Cinematic Sketches\n\n### Priority Generation Queue:\n1. **Panel 1:** Wide establishing shot - C-School exterior (cyberpunk aesthetic)\n2. **Panel 2:** Close-up - Protagonist's face, reflected screen light showing alert\n3. **Panel 3:** Split panel - Victim student / threatening message\n4. **Panel 4:** Dynamic angle - Server room infiltration\n5. **Panel 5:** Tension shot - Compromised faculty member reveal\n\n**Tone:** High-tech thriller, paranoia, institutional corruption\n**Color Palette:** Cool blues, warning reds, sterile whites\n\n---\n\n**Next Action Required:** Generate cinematic sketches for Panels 1-5 using ARIA Cinematic Base specifications.",
